{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.21,
   "end": 4.23,
   "text": "The reason most entrepreneurs fail has nothing to do with talent."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.77,
   "end": 5.31,
   "text": "It's this."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.61,
   "end": 10.65,
   "text": "If you want to succeed at anything, starting a business, becoming an entrepreneur, or leaving"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.65,
   "end": 14.21,
   "text": "your W-2, it has to be something that you're passionate about."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.87,
   "end": 15.25,
   "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.47,
   "end": 16.57,
   "text": "Longevity."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.51,
   "end": 21.11,
   "text": "Warren Buffett didn't become one of the richest investors ever because he had one"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.11,
   "end": 21.77,
   "text": "great year."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.09,
   "end": 26.97,
   "text": "He became legendary because he believed in his philosophy and he stuck with it for 60"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.97,
   "end": 31.47,
   "text": "plus years when the market dropped, when the market excelled, he stuck to that strategy"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.47,
   "end": 33.71,
   "text": "and he genuinely loves this stuff."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.17,
   "end": 35.87,
   "text": "The same thing is true with entrepreneurship."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.59,
   "end": 39.31,
   "text": "The winner isn't the person that's the rookie of the year."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.43,
   "end": 44.35,
   "text": "It's the person that gets a little better every single year and refuses to quit the game."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.53,
   "end": 49.85,
   "text": "Whether it's an up year, a down year, they find a way to stay in and over time they"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.85,
   "end": 52.47,
   "text": "continue to excel and become that winner."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.01,
   "end": 58.65,
   "text": "If you're building something you love in real estate, follow, I share what 10 years of staying"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.65,
   "end": 60.23,
   "text": "in the game actually looks like."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.76,
   "end": 70.48,
   "text": "If you're thinking about making the jump from your W-2, DM me the word game and let's talk"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.48,
   "end": 72.0,
   "text": "about building something that lasts."
  }
 ],
